  "description": "Min-Jun sets up a fake profile to get Eun-Ju, his crush, to accept his follow request on social media. Now, with her daily activities and whereabouts available at his fingertips, he uses this information to move in as her next-door neighbor. But little did Min-Jun know, that Eun-Ju’s life isn’t anything like what she posts online–this sends him down an unexpected path, where he learns that following Eun-Ju turns out to have its consequences. \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS, edited) \n\n*Warning: This series contains themes regarding mental health, sexual violence and child abuse that may not be suitable for all readers. Viewer discretion is advised.*",
